flickos-branding (1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Depend on plymouth-themes: it provides two-step.so, which the FlickOS theme
    uses. Without it plymouth-set-default-theme failed and the build aborted.
  * Divert base-files' os-release and issue files with --no-rename and keep the
    originals ourselves; dpkg-divert warns that renaming files of an Essential
    package is dangerous.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:00:00 +0800

